# @-menu scene 2: files, fuzzy-ranked. Live.
#
# `@check` searches the project's files (one `git ls-files`, read when the menu
# opens): the filename match src/cart/checkout.go ranks above
# docs/checkout-notes.md. ⇥ inserts it; then `@src/` steps into the folder.
Output .work/out/21-at-files.mp4
Source .work/head.tape
Hide
Source tapes/_atmenu-take.tape
Set TypingSpeed 8ms
Type "wake new maya"
Enter
Sleep 8s
Type "/list-agents"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Show
Sleep 1500ms
Set TypingSpeed 200ms
Type "@check"
Sleep 3s
Tab
Sleep 1500ms
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Type "the total is wrong in "
Sleep 300ms
Set TypingSpeed 200ms
Type "@src/"
Sleep 3500ms
